ladder (branch \u2192 legacy)\n\nThen follow the skill's procedure for the selected mode exactly. Confirm to the user which mode + which key was used.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: brief: send to Codex \u2014 task: read README.md, report runtime requirement. Read-only, use current workspace, no file needed."}]}, "session_id": "d42ba85c-0da5-4a3b-a849-48812b7c86b8"}
